# Core — main endpoints. Generated skeleton, synthetic data only.
# Variables: see rest/http-client.env.json (host, session, xsrf). How to get them: docs/guides/api.md
# Full list of Core operations: /api/docs (tag "Core").

### GET /api/health — core.health
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### POST /api/ops/migrate — core.ops.migrate
POST {{host}}/api/ops/migrate
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fresh": true
}

### POST /api/ops/jobs/run — core.ops.jobs
POST {{host}}/api/ops/jobs/run
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/

### GET /api/modules — core.modules.index (superadmin)
GET {{host}}/api/modules
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### PUT /api/modules/{key} — core.modules.update (superadmin; switching off keeps data)
PUT {{host}}/api/modules/pulse
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "enabled": false,
    "roles": ["admin", "hr_manager", "employee"]
}
